# Milestone 3: Supplier & Transportation Analytics

## Overview

This milestone focuses on transportation analytics and estimated transportation costs using Power BI and AIS vessel movement data.

## Implementation

* Developed transportation-related KPIs and DAX measures.
* Created an estimated transportation cost measure using vessel travel distance and an assumed cost-per-kilometre value.
* Analysed active movement rate and average active distance per vessel.
* Added interactive slicers and dashboard visuals to support transportation analysis.

## Dataset Limitation

The original AIS dataset does not contain actual supplier details, carrier information, transportation costs, shipment costs, or supplier quality scores. Therefore, transportation costs are estimated using an assumed cost-per-kilometre value. These estimates should not be interpreted as actual business costs.

